    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_d9c27331",
      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "soldiers",
      "label": "combatants in historical battle scene",
      "description": "Multiple soldiers in 18th-century military uniforms are engaged in close combat. Some wear blue coats with red accents, while others wear red coats. They are wielding bayonets and swords, and appear to be fighting on uneven, dirt-covered terrain. Their postures suggest intense action, with some falling or being pushed back. The scene depicts a chaotic melee, likely from a historical conflict such as the American Revolutionary War.",
