      "description": "A chaotic melee battle scene featuring soldiers in 18th-century military uniforms engaged in close combat on uneven, dirt-covered terrain. Soldiers are wielding bayonets and swords, with some falling or being pushed back, indicating intense action. The scene is overlaid with text that critiques the historical hypocrisy of fighting for independence while enslaving people.",
